      395.28,
      562.49,
      513.35
    ],
    "text": "All person interested in the aforesaid land on which aservitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorised in writing, beforeme at Matale Divisional Secretariat on the 20th day ofDecember 2017 at 9.30 a.m. and are hereby requested to notifyto me in writing [in duplicate] on or before the 13th day ofDecember, 2017, the nature of their interests in the land,the particulars of their claims for compensation for theacquisition of the said land, the amount of compensationand the details of the computation of such amount.",
